% expect-output: 1.0
% expect-output: 10.0
% expect-output: 10.0
% Scenario: restore restores line width. save performs the implicit
% graphics save and restore returns to it; the current path is part of
% the state too (PLRM3 §4.2), so gsave/grestore brings back the current
% point. The stroke that follows needs no width setting in the IR.
1 setlinewidth save 5 setlinewidth restore currentlinewidth =
10 10 moveto gsave 20 20 lineto grestore currentpoint exch = =
50 50 lineto stroke
showpage
